@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 140
skinparam ParticipantPadding 30
skinparam BoxPadding 40

title Диаграмма последовательности - оформление заказа

actor Пользователь as user
participant "Angular\nFrontend" as fe
participant "Ocelot API Gateway" as gw
participant UserService as us
participant ProductService as ps
participant OrderService as os
participant Redis as redis
participant Stripe as stripe
participant Kafka as kafka
database MongoDB as mongo

== 1. Авторизация и получение JWT ==
user -> fe: Вводит логин и пароль
fe -> gw: POST /api/auth/login
gw -> us: login request
us -> us: Check credentials in MySQL
us --> gw: 200 + JWT
gw --> fe: JWT token
fe -> fe: Save to localStorage

note right of fe: Пользователь авторизован

== 2. Просмотр каталога и корзины ==
user -> fe: Открывает каталог
fe -> gw: GET /api/products (Bearer JWT)
gw -> ps: forward request
ps --> gw: List of products
gw --> fe: JSON

note right of redis
  Корзина хранится в Redis\n  по ключу cart:{userId}
end note

fe -> gw: GET /api/orders/cart
gw -> os: get cart
os -> redis: GET cart:{userId}
redis --> os: Items + quantities
os --> gw: Cart data
gw --> fe: Cart data

== 3. Оформление заказа ==
user -> fe: Нажимает «Оформить заказ»
fe -> gw: POST /api/orders/create
gw -> os: create order (items + address)
os --> kafka: ProductReserveRequested

note right of kafka
  ProductService асинхронно\n  резервирует товар в MySQL
end note

alt Товара достаточно
    os -> stripe: Create PaymentIntent
    stripe --> os: client_secret
    os --> gw: client_secret
    gw --> fe: client_secret

    user -> fe: Заполняет данные карты\nв Stripe Elements
    fe -> stripe: confirmCardPayment(client_secret)
    stripe --> fe: Payment result

    alt Оплата успешна
        fe -> gw: POST /api/orders/confirm {payment_intent_id}
        gw -> os: confirm payment
        os -> stripe: Retrieve PaymentIntent
        stripe --> os: status: succeeded
        os -> mongo: Save order (status = Paid)
        os --> kafka: OrderPaid + OrderCreated

        note right of kafka
          → ProductService: списание со склада\n          → UserService: статистика\n          → Уведомления, email и т.д.
        end note

        os --> gw: 200 Order created
        gw --> fe: 200 Order created
        fe --> user: Спасибо за покупку!

    else Оплата не удалась
        os --> kafka: OrderPaymentFailed
        os --> gw: Payment failed
        gw --> fe: Payment failed
        fe --> user: Ошибка оплаты
    end

else Недостаточно товара
    os --> gw: 409 Conflict
    gw --> fe: 409 Conflict
    fe --> user: Товар закончился
end
@enduml